# Placeholder for an optional extra CA bundle.
#
# If you are behind a TLS-inspecting proxy (some universities, corporate
# networks, this sandbox), replace the contents of this file with your
# proxy's root CA in PEM format and rebuild:
#
#   make build
#
# When the file contains no "BEGIN CERTIFICATE" marker (as shipped), the
# Dockerfile detects that, removes the placeholder during build, and
# proceeds with the system CA store only. No action needed for students
# on a normal home / dorm network.
#
# WARNING: do not commit a real CA certificate here. Your school's
# TLS-inspection CA is not a public secret, but it is fingerprintable and
# revealing. Keep changes to this file local.
